+- **Drift test:** tests/org/generate.test.mjs (`npm run test:org`, added to `verify`), and `node tools/org/generate.mjs --check` added to `npm run check`, so CI's check step fails on drift. Before this, nothing tested generate.mjs.
+- **Portfolio-manager scope (§3):** its role data now states the register, budget lines, 80%/100% forecasts, capacity and review-draw table, cross-lane priority and Project Review secretary duties, pointing to company/ops/token-budget.md and company/rituals/records/2026-10-16-project-review.md. No new authority: it still proposes budgets and may not approve them.
+- **Handoff shape (§2):** company/ceo-office/handoff-map.md §7, six fields mapped onto the existing mailbox and batch fields.
+- **Mechanism review (Appendix B):** eight questions in company/rituals/templates/coe.md and company/decisions/README.md; COE actions carry merged / installed / active / effective, each with its own evidence.
+
+## Rests on
+
+- company/reviews/org/2026-10-17-external-assessment.md (finding 6, §2, §3, Appendix B)
+- company/decisions/2026-10-16-founder-agent-cap-14.md, 2026-10-16-founder-mailbox-dispatch.md, 2026-10-14-usage-upgrade.md, company/experiments/EXP-003-sonnet-builders.md
+
+## Revisit if
+
+- A founder decision changes a cap, the single writer or the builder model (edit tools/org/caps.mjs or the generator, regenerate; the test will say where).
+- EXP-003 reports: its decision rule may move the builder default.
+
+## Mechanism review (the drift test)
+
+1. Recurring failure: active onboarding kept a rule after a decision changed it (26 roles since 10-13; 8 agents since 10-16; board/progress since 10-14).
+2. Owner: chief-of-staff-ceo-office (the text); tools-lead (the generator and test).
+3. Trigger: every `npm run check` and `npm run verify`.
+4. Action it can change: check fails, so a role edit without regeneration, or a cap change in dispatch-check without caps.mjs, cannot pass CI.
+5. Proof of use: a red check naming the drifted file (the negative test was run on this branch: an appended line in company/roles/qa-tester.md failed both `--check` and the test).
+6. Outcome and side effect: count of contradictions found in the next onboarding audit (target 0 of these four kinds); side effect: one more file (caps.mjs) to keep in step with dispatch-check.mjs.
+7. Simpler alternative: delete all numbers from prose. Done for the role count; caps stay because operators need them in the text.
+8. Keep, revise or retire on: the WBR after 2026-10-24; retire the operating-loop line check if dispatch-check imports caps.mjs directly (tools-lead's call).
